<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Banco Santander-Chile upped.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Banco Santander-Chile upped.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Morgan Grenfell analyst Peter Howe has raised his rating for Banco Santander-Chile to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We believe the bank should see an operational turnaround; it has significant upside potential and is unlikely to see a share price this low again,&quot; Howe wrote in a July 23 report.</p>
<p>-- He set a one-year target price of 35 pesos. The shares closed Wednesday in Santiago at 27.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
